=== HW-025: is VMIDSEL fast-charge (0x0D[1:0]=3) the lever on the 6.2 s? ===

  the ES8311 has no MICBIAS pin. VMID, ADCVREF and DACVREF are three 1 uF

  filtering caps, the 0x00 reset powers the analog down and discharges them,

  and charging them back is the six seconds. 0x0D[1:0] is the documented

  charge-speed control. All eight reference drivers write 1 (normal). So do

  we. Nobody has tried 3 (fast). A regressed steady-state floor would make

  it not worth having, so both numbers are printed.

