=== ES8311 sample-rate sweep ===

regs  : the clock registers read back off the chip over I2C

lrck  : the frame clock MEASURED against the kernel cycle counter,

        which is not derived from the I2S clock

adc   : the microphone noise floor with the amplifier off. A codec

        whose clock tree did not lock cannot run its modulator and

        returns zeros or a stuck constant here

tone  : the captured level with the amplifier on. Reported, not

        asserted: this speaker couples weakly into this microphone.

        Judge the speaker by ear; the pitch rises across the sweep

        because the tone table was made for 16 kHz

